event: response.output_text.done
data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","sequence_number":76,"item_id":"msg_0fff0f77eadc315d016aca0efede248196a82252166d6cdad7","output_index":1,"content_index":0,"text":"The move controls and persistence changes are in place. Verification found two old assertions affected by the new requirements: moving must be disabled when there’s no destination, and renaming a project must update its name in other projects’ destination lists. I’ll update those assertions and add coverage for repeated moves, ordering, filters, archived projects, and restarts.\n","logprobs":[]}

